Hi all,

Many thanks for your patience while I worked through the issues
wrought by NCEP's transition to https.  Originally I thought this
would be a simple fix as it was for the archived models via NCDC...but
no such luck.  I've had to rewrite the html parsers all by hand.

CRAN is down until January 2nd but I have a new release ready for download:
https://r-forge.r-project.org/scm/viewvc.php/trunk/rNOMADS/rNOMADS_2.4.0.tar.gz?root=rnomads&view=log

Real time grib downloading (via GribGrab) now works; DODS
(openDAP-alt) still does not.  I think enough users rely on Grib that
it was worth releasing anyway.

Best,

Danny

